</script><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Food Budget Impact Calculator | World Food Crisis</title><meta name="description" content="Model how a hypothetical change in grocery prices could affect your monthly or annual food budget."><link rel="canonical" href="https://worldfoodcrisis.pages.dev/tools/food-budget-impact/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site.css"><script is:inline src="/assets/main.js" defer></script><script is:inline src="/assets/tools.js" defer></script></head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a><div class="topline"><div class="container topline-inner"><span>Practical guide</span><span>Scenario, not forecast</span></div></div><header class="site-header"><div class="container header-inner"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">F<span>+</span></span><span class="brand-words"><strong>World Food Crisis</strong><small>Facts before fear.</small></span></a><nav class="primary-nav"><a href="/#analysis">Analysis</a><a href="/data/">Data desk</a><a href="/#guides">Practical guides</a><a href="/about/">About</a></nav></div></header><main id="main"><header class="page-hero"><div class="container"><nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><span>Calculator</span></nav><h1>Food Budget Impact Calculator</h1><p>Estimate how a hypothetical change in your grocery basket could affect monthly or annual spending.</p></div></header><div class="container page-content page-content-narrow"><p>This simple scenario tool is arithmetic, not a price forecast. Enter your current basket spending and test a hypothetical percentage change.</p><div class="tool-card"><form id="budget-form"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="currency">Currency</label><select id="currency"><option value="USD">USD — US dollar</option><option value="GBP">GBP — British pound</option><option value="CAD">CAD — Canadian dollar</option><option value="INR" selected>INR — Indian rupee</option><option value="EUR">EUR — euro</option><option value="AUD">AUD — Australian dollar</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="period">Budget period</label><select id="period"><option value="monthly" selected>Monthly</option><option value="annual">Annualized (12 months)</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="basket">Current grocery basket spend</label><input id="basket" type="number" min="0" max="100000000" step="0.01" value="12000" required><span class="field-help">Enter the amount for the selected period.</span></div><div class="field"><label for="change">Hypothetical price change (%)</label><input id="change" type="number" min="-100" max="500" step="0.1" value="10" required><span class="field-help">Use a negative number to model a decrease.</span></div></div><button class="button button-dark" type="submit" style="margin-top:20px">Calculate impact</button></form><div class="result-box" aria-live="polite"><span class="result-label">Estimated change</span><div class="result-value" id="result-value">INR 1,200.00 more per month</div><p id="result-copy">At a hypothetical 10% change, the monthly basket would cost INR 13,200.00. Assumes the entire basket changes by the same percentage.</p></div></div><h2>How to interpret it</h2><p>Actual households buy different products, quantities and brands; prices change at different rates; substitutions affect spending. Use your own receipts or a clearly defined basket for more realistic planning.</p><p>The <a href="https://www.fao.org/worldfoodsituation/FoodPricesIndex/en/">FAO Food Price Index</a> tracks globally traded commodities and does not directly forecast your local grocery bill. See our <a href="/articles/food-prices-vs-shortages/">explainer on food prices and shortages</a>.</p></div></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="container footer-bottom"><span>© <span data-year>2026</span> World Food Crisis</span><span>Sources over speculation.</span></div></footer></body></html>